    "scale-class": {
      "description": "How big the entity is, as a class. The tag is the coarse label; tag_meta gives the numeric band its longest axis falls in, so a filter is arithmetic rather than opinion (law 8). The bands are contiguous and half-open: min <= longest_axis < max.",
      "cardinality": "one",
